# Olduum with its era module, modules/era/lua/quests/ahturhgan/olduum.lua, enabled by xi.pre(ROV) (RESTRICT_CONTENT 1,
# ENABLE_ROV 0): the wait for another ring is 24 hours. Two level 75 Warriors in Wajaom Woodlands, each with a Lightning
# Band and Olduum completed (GMs). Main: the band traded to the Leypoint: 2, finished: the module's wrap: the base gives
# the ring, takes the band and sets Wait = now + 60; Wait changed: Wait = now + 86400 (1800086400; the quest alone sets
# 1800000060: the trace's char var shows which). Whitegate: Dkhaaya: the ring held: 7. Bob: the band traded: 2; a GM
# gives the ring while it is open; finished: the base does nothing (the ring held): Wait unchanged: the module nothing.
module modules/era/lua/quests/ahturhgan/olduum.lua
lists WajaomWoodlands/Leypoint/onTrade WajaomWoodlands/onEventFinish/2 AhtUrhganWhitegate/Dkhaaya/onTrigger
char zone=WajaomWoodlands pos=-198.5,-8.5,80.058 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=WajaomWoodlands pos=-198.5,-8.5,81.5 job=WAR lvl=75
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_ROV 0
item LightningBand
quest AhtUrhgan.Olduum completed
bob: item LightningBand
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.Olduum completed
login
trade Leypoint LightningBand x1         # no ring, the band: 2
finish                                  # the ring; the band taken; the module: Wait = now + 86400
warp -71.7,0,-5.842 AhtUrhganWhitegate
trigger Dkhaaya                         # the ring held: 7
finish
bob: login
bob: trade Leypoint LightningBand x1    # bob: 2
bob: item OlduumRing                    # a GM, while 2 is open
bob: finish                             # the ring held: the base does nothing; Wait unchanged: the module nothing
